    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI IAO Correspondence Process\n\n**Purpose:**\nHandles IAO applicant-correspondence events that may need a fee payment from the applicant.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI IAO Process for `foi-iao-correnspodence` (the existing event spelling).\n\n**Processing:**\nReads the event payload into standard fields. If the request status is Closed, it stops with no action. Otherwise it builds a fee-payment request: event foi-fee-payment, feeAction initiate, serviceKey correspondence, payment status NOT PAID, and the payment expiry date from the payload.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nStarts FOI Fee Processing without waiting for it (fire-and-forget). That workflow creates the online payment and notifies the applicant.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "48cc826d-8188-4a2c-91cf-77959092fba3",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -704,
        -192
      ]
    }
